a photo of loved one in,

00:01:09.319 --> 00:01:11.530
but...
I haven't met anyone though.

00:01:11.613 --> 00:01:14.199
Well, I got that from
a real story you told me.

00:01:14.283 --> 00:01:15.909
-Yes, I know.
-On a podcast.

00:01:15.993 --> 00:01:17.953
Yeah.
That really happened to me.

00:01:18.036 --> 00:01:20.122
Yeah, which was a woman
you worked with, wasn't it?

00:01:20.205 --> 00:01:23.083
Yeah. I had a job
in a worming tablet factory.

00:01:24.459 --> 00:01:25.502
It's like Alan Bennett,
innit?

00:01:26.670 --> 00:01:28.297
