00:01:41.351 --> 00:01:42.728
One of those you meant
to put a picture in?

00:01:42.811 --> 00:01:44.521
Yeah, she said "You meant
to put a picture in,

00:01:44.605 --> 00:01:45.981
but I haven't
met anyone yet."

00:01:47.232 --> 00:01:48.442
I know, awful!

00:01:48.525 --> 00:01:50.360
