"And you're fired."

00:01:50.444 --> 00:01:52.029
Yeah.
Oh, by the way, yeah...

00:01:52.112 --> 00:01:53.030
Yeah.

00:01:53.113 --> 00:01:54.907
So, I got that,
changed it a bit.

00:01:54.990 --> 00:01:56.992
