00:02:11.089 --> 00:02:15.135
Even though it was comedy
and there was no--

00:02:15.219 --> 00:02:16.762
When you're close
to someone else

00:02:16.845 --> 00:02:18.305
-in a scene. Very funny.
-It's just funny.

00:02:18.388 --> 00:02:21.767
