00:02:28.815 --> 00:02:30.442
First time we nailed it
without laughing.

00:02:30.526 --> 00:02:32.319
You laughed, even though
you weren't in the scene.

00:02:32.402 --> 00:02:34.780
Because I didn't realise
how awkward it was,

00:02:34.863 --> 00:02:37.449
even as a joke.
Favourite Matt moment?

00:02:37.533 --> 00:02:41.787
I think
probably my favourite,

00:02:41.870 --> 00:02:43.330
certainly my favourite stuff
to shoot,

00:02:43.413 --> 00:02:44.748
