to tennis to squash.

00:02:53.757 --> 00:02:57.261
That was just a huge amount
of fun to shoot, and yeah,

00:02:57.344 --> 00:02:58.178
I love watching it.

00:02:59.263 --> 00:03:01.098
When we were playing squash,
there was a point where

00:03:01.181 --> 00:03:02.724
