00:03:02.808 --> 00:03:04.268
'Cause you was beating me,

00:03:04.351 --> 00:03:05.811
I was getting wound up
about you beating me,

00:03:05.894 --> 00:03:07.354
and then you were
winding me up even more.

00:03:07.437 --> 00:03:09.565
