-All goes in.

00:03:09.648 --> 00:03:11.900
There's a lot of me
and Tony…

00:03:11.984 --> 00:03:14.611
There's a lot me
that loves that stuff.

00:03:14.695 --> 00:03:17.030
-The need to win. Yeah.
-Yeah.

00:03:17.114 --> 00:03:19.283
When I first had
a game of squash, ever,

00:03:19.366 --> 00:03:20.784
I'd had three pints.

00:03:20.868 --> 00:03:21.743
It was where I used to work,

00:03:21.827 --> 00:03:23.537
