00:04:07.539 --> 00:04:08.624
I mean, that's disgusting.

00:04:08.707 --> 00:04:10.000
-What?
-What!

00:04:10.083 --> 00:04:12.211
It's great, it's so great.

00:04:12.294 --> 00:04:13.795
