the opposite.

00:12:22.117 --> 00:12:23.660
And he doesn't
feel sorry for him at all.

00:12:23.744 --> 00:12:25.037
Doesn't feel sorry.
You gotta keep going.

00:12:25.120 --> 00:12:26.330
And he just says that,

00:12:26.413 --> 00:12:27.915
he says that nervously,
the actor,

00:12:27.998 --> 00:12:30.542
-he goes, gotta keep going.
-Oh, gosh.

00:12:30.626 --> 00:12:34.213
'Cause he's even worried
about burdening someone.

00:12:34.296 --> 00:12:35.422
But I think
what it also does,

00:12:35.506 --> 00:12:37.216
'cause that's not the first
episode, isn't it, I think?

00:12:37.299 --> 00:12:38.425
Yeah, it is. Yeah.

00:12:38.509 --> 00:12:40.802
And it tells you,
that in the show,

00:12:40.886 --> 00:12:43.430
